{"info":{"name":"BMA-53 알림 목록/읽음처리 API (S7)","description":"S7 알림 목록/읽음처리 API 검증 컬렉션.\n\n두 계정으로 호감→매칭→메시지→다음 단계 요청→매칭 종료 흐름을 만들어 각 사건이 알림으로 쌓이는지, 사건 코드(eventCode)와 클릭 이동 정보(target)가 S7 사양대로 내려오는지, 개별/전체 읽음·unreadOnly·페이지·권한을 검증한다.\nRunner 로 위에서부터 순서대로 실행해야 한다.\n\n사전 조건\n- docker compose up -d --build\n\n검증 항목: 빈 상태, MATCH_LIKED/MATCH_CREATED/MESSAGE_RECEIVED/REVEAL_REQUESTED(S7-12)/MATCH_ENDED(S7-14) 와 target 화면·ID, 안읽음 수, 개별 읽음(멱등·404), 전체 읽음(updatedCount), unreadOnly, 페이지, 401.","schema":"https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"},"item":[{"name":"1. 사용자 A 회원가입","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// 매 실행마다 새 계정과 새 닉네임을 쓴다. 반복 실행해도 깨지지 않게 한다.","const t = Date.now();","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"emailA\", \"noti-a-\" + t + \"@bma.test\");","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"emailB\", \"noti-b-\" + t + \"@bma.test\");","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"nickA\", \"알림A\" + (t % 100000));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"nickB\", \"알림B\" + (t % 100000));"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userA\", pm.response.json().data.userId);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","signup"]}}},{"name":"2. 로그인 A","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenA\", pm.response.json().data.accessToken);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","login"]}}},{"name":"3. A 알림 목록 - 빈 상태 (S7-10)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"content=[], totalElements=0\", () => { pm.expect(d.content).to.eql([]); pm.expect(d.totalElements).to.eql(0); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?page=0&size=20","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","notifications"],"query":[{"key":"page","value":"0"},{"key":"size","value":"20"}]}}},{"name":"4. A 안읽음 수 0","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"unreadCount=0\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.unreadCount).to.eql(0));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/unread-count","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","notifications","unread-count"]}}},{"name":"5. 사용자 B 회원가입","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userB\", pm.response.json().data.userId);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailB}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","signup"]}}},{"name":"6. 로그인 B","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenB\", pm.response.json().data.accessToken);"]}}],"request":{"method":"PO